working class of athletes on campus and not necessarily there to be part of the

62
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:17,360
educating class as most students in other groups are.

63
00:05:17,900 --> 00:05:23,480
Compared with other groups, I think the numbers in this group at those 65 schools

64
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:28,840
are something like just barely, more than half of the black male athletes graduate

65
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:30,620
